```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    participant U as User
    participant S as Login Screen
    participant AC as AuthController
    participant AR as AuthRepository
    participant AS as AuthService
    participant D as Dio Client
    participant G as API Gateway
    participant US as User Service
    participant SS as SecureStorage
    participant R as GoRouter
    
    U->>S: Enter email & password
    S->>AC: login(email, password)
    AC->>AR: login(email, password)
    AR->>AS: login(email, password)
    AS->>D: POST /auth/login
    D->>G: HTTP Request + headers
    G->>US: Proxy to User Service
    US->>US: Validate credentials
    US-->>G: {user, token}
    G-->>D: 200 OK + JSON
    D-->>AS: Response
    AS-->>AR: UserModel + token
    AR->>SS: saveToken(token)
    AR->>SS: saveUserId(userId)
    AR-->>AC: UserModel
    AC->>AC: Update state
    AC-->>S: Success
    S->>R: Navigate to /home
    R->>U: Show Home Screen
```
